Alembic Migration Environment — Perennia AI

This directory contains the Alembic migration environment for the
Perennia AI Mortgage CRM backend.

Migration files live in versions/ and form a linear revision chain.
The current head is 013_rls_remaining_tables.

To create a new migration:
    cd backend && alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description_here"

To run pending migrations:
    cd backend && alembic upgrade head

To check current state:
    cd backend && alembic current

To rollback one step:
    cd backend && alembic downgrade -1

Or use the helper script:
    cd backend && python scripts/migrate.py upgrade
    cd backend && python scripts/migrate.py current
    cd backend && python scripts/migrate.py downgrade -1

IMPORTANT: The existing init_db.py handles schema creation for the
production deployment. Alembic is used for incremental schema changes
after the initial setup.
